          "format": {
            "enabled": true,
            "format": "# 🚀 Tablero de Control (Ordenado por Descendente)\n\n> [!DANGER] 🔥 Urgencia Máxima\n> ```tasks\n> not done\n> path does not include Templates\n> priority is highest\n> sort by description reverse\n> limit 10\n> hide backlink\n> ```\n\n> [!WARNING] ⏫ Alta Prioridad\n> ```tasks\n> not done\n> path does not include Templates\n> priority is high\n> sort by description reverse\n> limit 10\n> hide backlink\n> ```\n\n> [!INFO] 🔽 Baja Prioridad\n> ```tasks\n> not done\n> path does not include Templates\n> priority is low\n> sort by description reverse\n> limit 10\n> hide backlink\n> ```\n\n> [!QUOTE] ⏬ Muy Baja\n> ```tasks\n> not done\n> path does not include Templates\n> priority is lowest\n> sort by description reverse\n> limit 10\n> hide backlink\n> ```\n\n> [!SUCCESS] ✅ Tareas Completadas (Recientes)\n> Aquí verás lo último que has terminado.\n> ```tasks\n> done\n> path does not include Templates\n> sort by done reverse\n> limit 150\n> hide backlink\n> ```\n\n\n"
          },
          "insertAfter": {
